
****** How to etrieve a file from tape ******
1. Retrieve a rawdata file from tape to /cache/hallc/hks09/raw/
   jcache get /mss/hallc/hks09/raw/hks09-hks_74120.log.*
2. Convert the rawdata to rootfile: /volatile/hallc/c-hks/E05-115/filename.root
   ./hb2root filename

****** List of sample rootfiles from Toshi on May 19, 2026 ******
I received sample rootfiles of each target from Toshi on May 19, 2026.
li7_9-3.root: Lithium_7 target, 
b10_9-3.root: Beryllium_10 target, 
c12_20uA_9-3.root: Carbon_12 target at 20uA, 
c12_35uA_9-3.root: Carbon_12 target at 35uA, 
ch2_9-3.root: Polyethylene target, 
ch2asc12_9-3.root: Polyethylene as a carbon_12 target,
cr52_9-3.root: Chromium_52 target, 



